WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:03.800
Right now in the army, most are our trusted men.

00:03.920 --> 00:07.300
If Chen Ying wants to kill me, it won't be that easy.

00:07.440 --> 00:10.200
Prince Ning has already taken control of the court,

00:10.500 --> 00:12.200
And holds all the advantages.

00:12.480 --> 00:14.300
If I raise troops now,

00:14.500 --> 00:16.100
It would be disloyalty.

00:16.320 --> 00:18.000
To march south under the guise of the Northern Expedition,

00:18.160 --> 00:19.500
Would be treachery.

00:19.600 --> 00:21.800
For brothers to slaughter one another,

00:22.000 --> 00:23.600
Is utterly unfilial.

00:23.800 --> 00:25.800
An army without a just cause—

00:26.000 --> 00:27.400
How could it ever prevail?

00:27.560 --> 00:29.840
Your Highness! Your Highness, please!

00:31.680 --> 00:33.200
My mind is made up.

00:33.360 --> 00:35.693
Speak of this matter no more.

00:40.440 --> 00:42.000
Since Lord Xie is here,

00:42.160 --> 00:43.920
Remain with me in the army.

00:44.000 --> 00:45.800
Zhu Yuanzhi.

00:46.080 --> 00:47.747
Tomorrow, you will accompany me

00:47.920 --> 00:49.800
To make a formal apology and bear punishment.

01:03.500 --> 01:08.500
The next day, you went in person to apologize. Chen Ying sent his confidants to escort you back to the imperial capital, where you were reunited with Xie Ruolan.

01:08.800 --> 01:13.800
Half a year later, a catastrophic fire suddenly broke out in the Prince of Jin's estate. More than forty souls residing within all tragically perished.
